r. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}\n\nIn the [[Great Rift Valley, Africa]], a female [[Silent Soldier]] fired the spell at [[Dante Vale]] who dodged the attack. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}","text":"Klaus hit and injured Dante Vale with this spell during their final battle on the rooftops of the Castle of Vlad Dracul. [The Vampire Loses Its Fangs]\n\nWhen Hoffman's Poisonfang spell hit Lok Lambert, his Powerbonded Baselaird experienced the same pain as Lok, resulting in him and Incubane defeating each other. [The Tower of Nostradamus]\n\nIn the Great Rift Valley, Africa, a female Silent Soldier fired the spell at Dante Vale who dodged the attack. [Sophie on Trial]"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* When [[Hoffman]] casts Poisonfang in \"[[The Blood Spiral]]\", it appears as a violet bolt instead of the usual green sludge. This is also the case with the [[TCG:SAS-121|Poisonfang TCG card]]. \n\n{{clear}}","text":"* When Hoffman casts Poisonfang in \"The Blood Spiral\", it appears as a violet bolt instead of the usual green sludge. This is also the case with the Poisonfang TCG card."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E03 DeFoe Poisonfang.png|[[DeFoe]] casting Poisonfang\nS2E32 Hoffman Sophie Poisonfang.jpg|thumb|Hoffman casts a violet version of Poisonfang\nS2E35 Dante Caliban Poisonfang.png\nS2E35 Myrmidon Suit Poisonfang.png\nS2E43 Harrison Poisonfang.png\nS2E46 Wilder Poisonfang.png\n</gallery>","text":"S1E03 DeFoe Poisonfang.png|DeFoe casting Poisonfang\nS2E32 Hoffman Sophie Poisonfang.jpg|thumb|Hoffman casts a violet version of Poisonfang\nS2E35 Dante Caliban Poisonfang.png\nS2E35 Myrmidon Suit Poisonfang.png\nS2E43 Harrison Poisonfang.png\nS2E46 Wilder Poisonfang.png"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR= Croc-venin\n|DUT=Gifslagtand\n|POR=Presa Negra, Garra Venenosa, Presa Venenosa\n}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Green-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]","text":"French: Croc-venin\nDutch: Gifslagtand\nPortuguese: Presa Negra, Garra Venenosa, Presa Venenosa"}],"full_text":"Poisonfang is a spell that produces a damaging green sludge from the casting Seeker's hands directed at the target. This spell often is used by members of the Organization and is similar to the acid that Kreutalk spits and to the Poisonheat spell.\n\n== History ==\nKlaus hit and injured Dante Vale with this spell during their final battle on the rooftops of the Castle of Vlad Dracul. [The Vampire Loses Its Fangs]\n\nWhen Hoffman's Poisonfang spell hit Lok Lambert, his Powerbonded Baselaird experienced the same pain as Lok, resulting in him and Incubane defeating each other. [The Tower of Nostradamus]\n\nIn the Great Rift Valley, Africa, a female Silent Soldier fired the spell at Dante Vale who dodged the attack. [Sophie on Trial]\n\n==Trivia==\n* When Hoffman casts Poisonfang in \"The Blood Spiral\", it appears as a violet bolt instead of the usual green sludge. This is also the case with the Poisonfang TCG card. \n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E03 DeFoe Poisonfang.png|DeFoe casting Poisonfang\nS2E32 Hoffman Sophie Poisonfang.jpg|thumb|Hoffman casts a violet version of Poisonfang\nS2E35 Dante Caliban Poisonfang.png\nS2E35 Myrmidon Suit Poisonfang.png\nS2E43 Harrison Poisonfang.png\nS2E46 Wilder Poisonfang.png\n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E39_Silent_Soldier_Poisonfang.png\n| aura  = Green<br>Violet\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[DeFoe]] <br> [[Harrison Fears]] <br> [[Hoffman]] <br> [[Klaus]] <br> [[Silent Soldiers]] <br> [[Suits]] <br> [[Wilder]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]]\n| first = \"[[Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]]\"\n| frname = Croc Venin\n}}'''Poisonfang''' is a spell that produces a damaging green sludge from the casting [[Seeker]]'s hands directed at the target. This spell often is used by members of [[the Organization]] and is similar to the acid that [[Kreutalk]] spits and to the [[Poisonheat]] spell.\n\n== History ==\n[[Klaus]] hit and injured [[Dante Vale]] with this spell during their final battle on the rooftops of the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]]. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}\n\nWhen [[Hoffman]]'s Poisonfang spell hit [[Lok Lambert]], his [[Baselaird|Powerbonded Baselaird]] experienced the same pain as Lok, resulting in him and [[Incubane]] defeating each other. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}\n\nIn the [[Great Rift Valley, Africa]], a female [[Silent Soldier]] fired the spell at [[Dante Vale]] who dodged the attack. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* When [[Hoffman]] casts Poisonfang in \"[[The Blood Spiral]]\", it appears as a violet bolt instead of the usual green sludge. This is also the case with the [[TCG:SAS-121|Poisonfang TCG card]]. \n\n{{clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E03 DeFoe Poisonfang.png|[[DeFoe]] casting Poisonfang\nS2E32 Hoffman Sophie Poisonfang.jpg|thumb|Hoffman casts a violet version of Poisonfang\nS2E35 Dante Caliban Poisonfang.png\nS2E35 Myrmidon Suit Poisonfang.png\nS2E43 Harrison Poisonfang.png\nS2E46 Wilder Poisonfang.png\n</gallery>\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR= Croc-venin\n|DUT=Gifslagtand\n|POR=Presa Negra, Garra Venenosa, Presa Venenosa\n}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Green-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Green-aura spells","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic","Violet-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","